### Coffee Shop - Report Service manual test requests
### Run `uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8003` from report_service/ first.
### Every endpoint here requires an admin/staff access token issued by user_service.

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8003
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_OR_STAFF_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Manually pull the latest users/products/orders from user_service +
### operation_service into report_service's own database. Run this first if
### reports look empty (e.g. right after starting all three services).
POST {{baseUrl}}/report/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Sales summary (defaults to trailing 30 days if no dates given)
GET {{baseUrl}}/report/sales-summary?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Daily sales breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/report/daily-sales?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Top selling products
GET {{baseUrl}}/report/top-products?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-12-31&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Low stock alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/report/low-stock?threshold=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### User signup / role summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/report/users-summary?start_date=2026-01-01&end_date=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Customer token -> 403 Forbidden (reports are staff/admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/report/sales-summary
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_ACCESS_TOKEN
